    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>09.看太多电视会把脑子看坏吗？两名90后女子的实验结果令人震惊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/692e78ecfc7cb25ab07c5659</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">692e78ecfc7cb25ab07c5659</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Dec 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本来想聊聊电视剧如何塑造了我们的感情观，结果离题成了青春期糗事大放送！各位电子闺蜜们听着一乐，也欢迎分享分享你们的青春回忆～</span></p><span></span><p><span>天黑请闭眼，坏脑袋请睁眼～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 在还珠格格里，你当紫薇还是小燕子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1465">24:25</a> 初中往事：传纸条泄露天机，被大姐大带头孤立</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 贴吧评选校园美女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2990">49:50</a> 被LOVE集团成员选中的天命之女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4163">69:23</a> 游学糗事：姨妈血染红了别人家的床垫</span></p>]]></description>
